{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL0dyaWQlMjBEb3duJTIwUG93ZXIlMjBVcCUyMCUyODIwMjIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Grid Down Power Up","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gInkGCq29Ou7Izds9nTADxe1MPd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l3cDzfL0ZAUwbUZmLuQoz5IFX8C.jpg","description":"Our power grid is at grave risk of shutting down completely. An orchestrated physical attack, electromagnetic pulse attack (EMP), cyber-attack, or geomagnetic disturbance (GMD) could shut down our electricity grid for as long as one calendar year or longer. Our electric utility companies have not implemented sufficient precautions to protect our grid, yet they are aware of the dangers. Our state and federal officials are aware of the threat a shutdown poses, yet they haven’t passed any legislation that deals with the threat. This documentary helps us understand the threat, why it has become a threat, and demonstrates how we can fix this problem.\n\nReleased 18 May 2022 · United States of America · Language: English\nStudio: Paul Revere Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.3","imdb_id":"tt20782654","moviedb_id":990522,"tmdbId":990522,"cast":["Dennis Quaid"],"director":["David Tice"],"released":"2022-05-18T00:00:00.000Z","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"David Tice","character":"Director"},{"name":"Dennis Quaid","character":"Narrator","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lMaDAJHzsKH7U3dln2B3kY3rOhE.jpg"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"8JExHPzh_VE","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer: Grid Down Power Up Trailer","ytId":"8JExHPzh_VE"}],"links":[{"name":"Dennis Quaid","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Dennis%20Quaid"},{"name":"David Tice","category":"Director","url":"stremio:///search?search=David%20Tice"},{"name":"Documentary","category":"Genres","url":"stremio